      "description": "A sensitive health research dataset is accessible only to verified researchers from EU-based institutions, who hold a valid ethics approval, connect via an IDS TRUST+ certified connector, and agree to: log every access, limit their use to 24 hours, and delete all data after the access window expires. This policy combines patterns from Sections 91, 92, 94, 95, 98, 105, 107, 112, and 115 of the draft. It demonstrates compound constraint composition and multi-duty orchestration.",
